  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Дополнение «Герои прибывают» добавляет Железного человека, Человека-паука и многое другое!</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Расширение «Герои» добавляет Тора, Черную пантеру, Капитана Америку, Зелёную стрелу и многое другое!</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Включает различных мобов из Lycanites, Animalium и других модов!</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Исследуйте Лес Сумерек!</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Ссылки на моды:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp;</span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/animalium\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp;Animalium</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/baubles\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp;Baubles</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/ctm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">ConnectedTexturesMod</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/damage-indicators-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Damage Indicators Mod</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/farseek\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Farseek</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/foamfix-for-minecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">FoamFix для Minecraft</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/ftblib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">FTB Library</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/ftb-utilities\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">FTB Utilities</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/ftb-utilities-backups\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">FTB Utilities: Резервные копии</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/grimoire-of-gaia\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Гримуар Гайи</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/heroes-arrival\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Прибытие героев</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/heroesexpansion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">HeroesExpansion</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/iron-backpacks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp;Железные рюкзаки</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Just Enough Items (JEI)</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/llibrary\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">LLibrary</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/lucraft-core\" rel=\"nofollo